@summary_2023
title: Election summary
new-page: true
view-if: left_seats > 0
on-arrival: election_summary_seen = 1

= The result

PiS returns with **[+ pis_seats +] seats**. KO, the democratic centre and the
Left parties committed to the transfer hold **[+ coalition_democratic_seats +]
seats**. [? if third_way_split = 0: [+ third_way_display_name +]'s **[+ p2050_seats + psl_seats
+] deputies** won election through one committee; their later division into
PSL and Poland 2050 caucuses does not retroactively change its 8% threshold.?]
[? if third_way_split = 1: PSL and Poland 2050 fought on separate 5% lists, so
their seats were calculated separately.?]

The main **[+ left_party_name +]** list returns with **[+ left_seats +]
seats**. Separate Left parties hold **[+ left_splinter_seats +]** more.
The wider Left won **[+ left_family_vote_intent +]%** across **[+
left_lists_contesting +] lists**. **[+ left_lists_above_threshold +]** cleared
their filed threshold; **[+ left_threshold_wasted_vote +] points** were cast
through committees that won no representation under the national indicator.
The negotiated form was **[+ sejm_list_structure +]** at **[+
sejm_list_threshold +]%**: [+ sejm_list_members +].
Inside the main list there are **[+ nowa_lewica_seats +] Nowa Lewica**, **[+
razem_seats +] Razem** and **[+ left_pps_seats +] PPS** deputies. Cabinet
entry therefore requires both coalition arithmetic and an internal mandate.

- @senate_results_2023: Certify the Senate

@senate_results_2023
title: 2023 Senate election
new-page: true
on-arrival: election_senate_seen = 1

= One hundred district pluralities

The Senate is not apportioned from the national Sejm result. The simulation
counted **one contest in each of 100 single-member districts** and awarded
each seat to the candidate with the largest district vote. There is no
national threshold and no proportional correction.

Campaign arrangement: **[+ senate_pact_strategy +]**.
Rule: **[+ senate_election_rule +]**.
Closest simulated winning margin: **[+ senate_election_closest_margin +]
points**.

<div class="election-table">
<div class="election-table-head"><span>Committee family</span><span>Seats</span><span>Position</span><span>Status</span></div>
<div class="election-table-row"><span class="party party-pis">PiS and aligned right</span><b>[+ senate_pis_seats +]</b><span>right</span><span>district winners</span></div>
[? if senate_konf_seats > 0: <div class="election-table-row"><span class="party party-konf">Konfederacja and aligned right</span><b>[+ senate_konf_seats +]</b><span>right</span><span>district winners</span></div>?]
<div class="election-table-row"><span class="party party-ko">KO</span><b>[+ senate_ko_seats +]</b><span>democratic</span><span>district winners</span></div>
[? if senate_p2050_seats > 0: <div class="election-table-row"><span class="party party-p2050">Polska 2050</span><b>[+ senate_p2050_seats +]</b><span>democratic</span><span>district winners</span></div>?]
[? if senate_psl_seats > 0: <div class="election-table-row"><span class="party party-psl">PSL</span><b>[+ senate_psl_seats +]</b><span>democratic</span><span>district winners</span></div>?]
[? if senate_left_seats > 0: <div class="election-table-row"><span class="party party-lewica">Lewica</span><b>[+ senate_left_seats +]</b><span>democratic</span><span>district winners</span></div>?]
[? if senate_independent_seats > 0: <div class="election-table-row"><span>Independent candidates</span><b>[+ senate_independent_seats +]</b><span>unaligned</span><span>district winners</span></div>?]
</div>

**Democratic senators: [+ senate_democratic_seats +] · right-aligned
senators: [+ senate_right_seats +] · independents: [+
senate_independent_seats +].** The chamber is a **[+ senate_control +]**.

- @coalitions_2023: Examine governing arrangements

@coalitions_2023
title: Coalition arrangements
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.election_coalition_seen = 1;
const leftFamilySeatCeiling =
    Q.left_seats + Q.sld_breakaway_seats + Q.social_patriot_seats +
    Q.spring_breakaway_seats +
    Q.labor_left_seats + Q.young_left_seats +
    Q.razem_party_seats + Q.pps_party_seats + Q.tak_rozwoj_seats;
if (
    !Number.isFinite(Number(Q.left_committed_seats)) ||
    Q.left_committed_seats < Q.left_seats ||
    Q.left_committed_seats > leftFamilySeatCeiling
) {
    Q.left_splinter_support_votes =
        (Q.barons_party_relation >= 45 ? Q.sld_breakaway_seats : 0) +
        (Q.social_patriot_list_committee != "pis" &&
            Q.social_patriot_party_relation >= 45
            ? Q.social_patriot_seats : 0) +
        (Q.spring_party_relation >= 45 ? Q.spring_breakaway_seats : 0) +
        (Q.labor_party_relation >= 45 ? Q.labor_left_seats : 0) +
        (Q.progressives_party_relation >= 45 ? Q.young_left_seats : 0) +
        (Q.razem_party_relation >= 45 ? Q.razem_party_seats : 0) +
        (Q.pps_party_relation >= 45 ? Q.pps_party_seats : 0) +
        (Q.tak_rozwoj_parent_relation >= 45 ? Q.tak_rozwoj_seats : 0);
    Q.left_committed_seats =
        Q.left_seats + Q.left_splinter_support_votes;
}
Q.coalition_democratic_seats =
    Q.ko_seats + Q.p2050_seats + Q.psl_seats +
    Q.centrum_seats + Q.left_committed_seats;
Q.coalition_right_seats =
    Q.pis_seats + Q.konf_seats + Q.rozwoj_seats + Q.korona_seats +
    (Q.social_patriot_list_committee == "pis"
        ? Q.social_patriot_seats : 0);
Q.coalition_center_seats =
    Q.ko_seats + Q.p2050_seats + Q.psl_seats + Q.centrum_seats;
Q.coalition_pis_psl_seats = Q.pis_seats + Q.psl_seats +
    (Q.social_patriot_list_committee == "pis"
        ? Q.social_patriot_seats : 0);
if (!Number.isFinite(Number(Q.coalition_democratic_score))) {
    Q.coalition_democratic_score = 67;
}
if (!Number.isFinite(Number(Q.coalition_right_score))) {
    Q.coalition_right_score = 28;
}
if (!Number.isFinite(Number(Q.coalition_center_score))) {
    Q.coalition_center_score = 61;
}
if (!Number.isFinite(Number(Q.coalition_pis_psl_score))) {
    Q.coalition_pis_psl_score = 36;
}
!}

= Possible governments

<div class="coalition-option [? if coalition_democratic_seats >= 231: viable?]"><span>KO · democratic centre · Left parties</span><b>[+ coalition_democratic_seats +]</b><small>[? if coalition_democratic_seats >= 231: Majority · ?]compatibility [+ coalition_democratic_score +]/100</small></div>
<div class="coalition-option [? if coalition_center_seats >= 231: viable?]"><span>KO · PL2050 · PSL</span><b>[+ coalition_center_seats +]</b><small>[? if coalition_center_seats >= 231: Majority · ?]compatibility [+ coalition_center_score +]/100</small></div>
<div class="coalition-option [? if coalition_pis_psl_seats >= 231: viable?]"><span>PiS · PSL</span><b>[+ coalition_pis_psl_seats +]</b><small>[? if coalition_pis_psl_seats >= 231: Majority · ?]compatibility [+ coalition_pis_psl_score +]/100</small></div>
<div class="coalition-option [? if coalition_right_seats >= 231: viable?]"><span>PiS · Konfederacja[? if social_patriot_list_committee = "pis":  · Lewica Patriotyczna?]</span><b>[+ coalition_right_seats +]</b><small>[? if coalition_right_seats >= 231: Majority · ?]compatibility [+ coalition_right_score +]/100</small></div>

The numbers identify possibilities, not agreements. The formation sequence
will test relations, party resources and caucus defections. The Senate does
not appoint the cabinet, but a **[+ senate_control +]** will review every bill.
[? if senate_right_seats >= 51: A democratic Sejm cabinet would need an
absolute majority to remove hostile Senate amendments; a coalition that can
pass an ordinary bill may still fail that override.?]
[? if senate_democratic_seats >= 51: A democratic cabinet begins with a
friendly upper chamber, while a right cabinet would face the same amendment
problem.?]

